[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 962.069, "timestamp": "00:16:02", "text": "东西，对吧？我的意思是，你看，这只是一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 966.629, "timestamp": "00:16:06", "text": "一款让你玩得开心的游戏"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 969.829, "timestamp": "00:16:09", "text": "投入时间，你就能获得相应的工时。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 972.55, "timestamp": "00:16:12", "text": "值得。游戏会根据你玩了多少局给予奖励。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 976.509, "timestamp": "00:16:16", "text": "你花费的时间。你实际上会去……有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 981.749, "timestamp": "00:16:21", "text": "与PE NPC的实际互动"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 984.509, "timestamp": "00:16:24", "text": "到处都是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 987.069, "timestamp": "00:16:27", "text": "地图。就像"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 990.972, "timestamp": "00:16:30", "author": "@adthirnegii555", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/2Cc1YwU-uCrqW2z5qvi5AkqQE1B24SRxdmfPyDze9eyV1Sux1rRBrAOLxTFmE3GC3YMqYbZsL6k=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "so like a simulation"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 992.15, "timestamp": "00:16:32", "text": "嗯，不管你做了什么，你都会得到……"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 992.652, "timestamp": "00:16:32", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "\"ItsJustToHaveFun\"|alsoJoq-*UsesAguide8\"IhaveToFinishTheGameFast\""}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 996.389, "timestamp": "00:16:36", "text": "结果。就像你把混合物调得不好一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 998.949, "timestamp": "00:16:38", "text": "你得到一个糟糕的反馈，他们不喜欢它。如果你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1000.949, "timestamp": "00:16:40", "text": "调配得很好，他们很喜欢。他们购买"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1005.389, "timestamp": "00:16:45", "text": "来自你。这是一款模拟游戏。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1008.71, "timestamp": "00:16:48", "text": "是的，你可以参考这些指南。我必须"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1011.43, "timestamp": "00:16:51", "text": "先把这个游戏通关。不，我从没说过"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1013.43, "timestamp": "00:16:53", "text": "我得先把这个游戏通关。我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1016.55, "timestamp": "00:16:56", "text": "你看，我只是想赚钱而已。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1019.55, "timestamp": "00:16:59", "text": "我唯一为导游做的事"}]